  // Where in the yard you can choose to play, every one open, in menu order: the whole of it, or one
  // part, taped off all round (you can't walk out; paint flies over the tape). A part has its own ways
  // in (yaw 0 faces north, positive turns left), a spot the eliminated walk off to, and starts closer
  // together (rules.jsonc "spawning" scaled by spawnScale). Its opponent spawns, patrols, pickups and
  // objectives are the level's that lie inside it; with no way out inside it, the case goes out the way
  // you came in, and a part with no case spots or rooms to hold offers only last one standing.
  // Its picture in the menu is taken from the viewpoint named in "still" (the first inside it if left out).
