    {
      "id": "whole", "displayName": "The whole yard",
      "still": "over the yard",
      "description": "Everything inside the wall: the engine shed, the wagons on all four tracks, the footbridge, the goods shed, the signal box and the yard office. You come in at the south gate, the breach in the east wall or the gap in the west wall."
